WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.625
A program in memory, and a processor to run it.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:09.275
Fetch: copy the instruction from cell 0. The program counter moves on.

3
00:00:11.176 --> 00:00:13.726
Decode: work out what it means.

4
00:00:15.416 --> 00:00:18.641
Execute: the accumulator is now 5.

5
00:00:23.888 --> 00:00:27.888
The same three steps, again and again. The output is 8.
